     fix           : Reframe as: 'The investigator-assessed endpoint definition appeared in the ASCO Post and Cancer Therapy Advisor, though neither piece discussed what it implies about assessment bias in the context of the double-blind design.' The claim of 'little attention' is overstated; the detail was printed, just not analysed.

