     but           : OncoDaily, Biotech Blueprint, AJMC, CancerNetwork, BioPharm International, EMJ Reviews, and Pharmacy Times also attributed the figures correctly to KEYNOTE-942 (or omitted them entirely). The list of five outlets understates the breadth of correct attribution and could imply the others did not get it right.
